      "message": "Merge main into issue/2991-tilted-first-traverse-msg\n\nConflicts (keep both sides):\n- crates/sim/src/verify/types.rs: the PR's `tilted` field on\n  FirstTraverseLow and its 3+2 Display arm, beside main's new\n  FirstTraverseUnderTable variant and its arm (#3081).\n- crates/sim/src/verify/first_traverse.rs: main's shared `verdict()`\n  and the swept rotary law (#2965) with `tilted: false`; the PR's\n  tests beside main's tests.\n- crates/app/src/operation/first_traverse.rs: main's 3+2 steel and\n  table reading (#2987, #3081), with the PR's `in_user_frame` on the\n  stock and fixture verdict of a tilted frame.\n\nMain's new verdict sites in machine Z (first_traverse_posed.rs, the\nswept law tests) set `tilted: false`. The two match helpers in\nfirst_traverse_rotary.rs and first_traverse_mill_turn.rs use `..`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
